SUMMARY:Build Anything With Claude And WordPress
DESCRIPTION:WordPress Lancaster\nThis month Austin Ginder will give a talk
  "Build Anything With Claude And WordPress". From a few conversations with
  Claude Design to a few conversations to Claude Code\, turning ideas into 
 real websites powered by WordPress has never been easier. Will take a look
  a few recent real world projects along with tips and tricks to get the mo
 st out of your favorite AI agent like Claude Code.\n\nPizza 🍕 and intro
 ductions at 7pm. Come with your laptops\, ask questions and join the discu
 ssion.\n\n🗒️ About our location.\n\n* Free parking in lot off of mark
 et street. [See here for directions to The Candy Factory\, Warehouse D](ht
 tps://goo.gl/maps/2NFNcZFxQC1qi8M66).
